1:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","children":[["$","$Le",null,{"eyebrow":"Memorize, revise and retain","title":"Online Quran Memorization (Hifz)","description":"Private online Hifz classes for kids and adults, combining a suitable new portion with recent and older revision, recitation correction and teacher listening.","compact":true,"children":[["$","$Lb",null,{"className":"button button-ivory","href":"/free-assessment/","children":["Book free assessment ",["$","$Lc",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$9:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right"}]]}],["$","$Lf",null,{"className":"button button-ghost-light","children":[["$","$Lc",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["path",{"d":"M2.992 16.342a2 2 0 0 1 .094 1.167l-1.065 3.29a1 1 0 0 0 1.236 1.168l3.413-.998a2 2 0 0 1 1.099.092 10 10 0 1 0-4.777-4.719","key":"1sd12s"}]],"className":"lucide-message-circle"}]," Ask about this course"]}]]}],["$","$L10",null,{"items":[{"name":"Home","href":"/"},{"name":"Courses","href":"/courses/"},{"name":"Online Quran Memorization (Hifz)"}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"section section-paper","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"shell content-grid","children":[["$","article",null,{"className":"prose","children":[[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"Course overview"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Online Hifz classes built around revision, not speed alone"}],[["$","p","Memorizing a new passage is only one part of Hifz. A learner also needs to preserve recently learned verses, revisit older portions and correct recitation before mistakes become embedded. QuranCrest's online Quran memorization classes organize these responsibilities into a plan the learner can maintain.",{"children":"Memorizing a new passage is only one part of Hifz. A learner also needs to preserve recently learned verses, revisit older portions and correct recitation before mistakes become embedded. QuranCrest's online Quran memorization classes organize these responsibilities into a plan the learner can maintain."}],["$","p","A starting assessment checks reading accuracy, current memorized portions, recall strength, available practice time and the learner's goal. That goal may be selected short Surahs, Juz Amma, rebuilding forgotten memorization or a longer Hifz pathway. The assigned amount can increase or decrease according to retention rather than following the same target for every student.",{"children":"A starting assessment checks reading accuracy, current memorized portions, recall strength, available practice time and the learner's goal. That goal may be selected short Surahs, Juz Amma, rebuilding forgotten memorization or a longer Hifz pathway. The assigned amount can increase or decrease according to retention rather than following the same target for every student."}],["$","p","During a live one-to-one lesson, the student recites from memory while the tutor listens for omissions, substitutions, hesitation and pronunciation issues. New memorization is balanced with recent and older review. QuranCrest does not promise a fixed completion time because consistency, starting level, lesson frequency and independent revision differ for every learner.",{"children":"During a live one-to-one lesson, the student recites from memory while the tutor listens for omissions, substitutions, hesitation and pronunciation issues. New memorization is balanced with recent and older review. QuranCrest does not promise a fixed completion time because consistency, starting level, lesson frequency and independent revision differ for every learner."}]],["$","h2",null,{"children":"What the learner can work toward"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"outcome-grid","children":["$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14"]}],"$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c",["$L1d","$L1e"],false,"$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24"],"$L25","$L26"]}],"$L27"]}]}],"$L28","$L29","$L2a"]}]
